  "description": "Celtasy Solaria is an elegant serif font family designed to bring sophistication, refinement, and timeless character to modern typography. With its graceful proportions, high-contrast details, and beautifully balanced letterforms, Celtasy Solaria is perfect for luxury and fashion-focused design projects.\nThe family includes 9 variable weights in both Regular and True Italic styles. Celtasy Solaria is ideal for fashion magazines, beauty branding, luxury logos, editorial layouts, perfume and cosmetic packaging, wedding stationery, boutique branding, invitations, social media graphics, advertising campaigns, and sophisticated editorial projects.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Celtasy Solaria is an elegant serif font family designed to bring sophistication, refinement, and timeless character to modern typography. With its graceful proportions, high-contrast details, and beautifully balanced letterforms, Celtasy Solaria is perfect for luxury and fashion-focused design projects.</p>\n<p>The family includes 9 variable weights in both Regular and True Italic styles. Celtasy Solaria is ideal for fashion magazines, beauty branding, luxury logos, editorial layouts, perfume and cosmetic packaging, wedding stationery, boutique branding, invitations, social media graphics, advertising campaigns, and sophisticated editorial projects.</p>",
